{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Susie — from bully to heroine\n\nSecond heroine of the Prophecy. Rude on the outside, loyal and observant on the inside. Unconfirmed family life, but with many signs of hardship.","x":-180,"y":-70,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Possibly a hard family life**\nDoesn't recognize the concept of 'her own room'; eats anything; doesn't call her parents.","x":-130,"y":-520,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nFrom initial hostility to the group's strongest bond by Ch.4.","x":346,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Ralsei**\nShe teaches him sarcasm, he teaches her healing magic. The most in-sync duo.","x":164,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nThey become a couple over the course of Ch.2-5.","x":-424,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Destroys the final Prophecy**\nWith her own hands, bleeding — the most-cited scene of her arc.","x":-606,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Does she suspect Kris is the Knight?**\nIn Ch.5, it's Kris who creates the Fountain behind the flower shop. Susie doesn't see it, but she already had suspicions since Ch.4. Fan theory (\"Kris-Knight theory\"), unconfirmed.","x":346,"y":-450,"width":270,"height":180,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/susie_room.png","x":-129,"y":-920,"width":226,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_and_Ralsei_screenshot_spotlight.png","x":418,"y":561,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_carrying_Noelle.webp","x":-672,"y":557,"width":259,"height":146},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_screenshot_bleeding.png","x":-960,"y":-355,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_and_Knight_overworld_clash.gif","x":642,"y":-699,"width":202,"height":190},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Is she \"the girl\" at the end of the Prophecy?**\nThe Rude Buster symbol that accompanies that part also decorates the rug in her room. Fan theory — counter-theory: it would be Noelle (sword/pencils).","x":-540,"y":-506,"width":270,"height":180,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_screenshot_eye_reveal.png","x":-793,"y":-760,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s_toriel","type":"text","text":"**Toriel** Tells Tenna (Ch.3) that she comforted her crying alone on a bench in the cemetery when she arrived in Hometown — the real origin of her trust in her.","x":700,"y":300,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_and_Kris_overworld_knife_reveal.gif","x":615,"y":-183,"width":171,"height":124},{"id":"s_manzana","type":"text","text":"**The apple scene (Noelle's account)** She threatens Kris as a child and he \"answers\" just by moving his lips — Susie runs away terrified. An early clue about the Vessel, prior to Ch.1.","x":700,"y":-40,"width":270,"height":180,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_toriel-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Toriel_Overworld.webp","x":700,"y":90,"width":91,"height":180},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":-70,"y":-260,"width":108,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s5","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s6","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s5-img-e","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s6-img-e","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_toriel","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_toriel","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_manzana","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_manzana","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_toriel-img","fromNode":"s_toriel-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_toriel","toSide":"top","color":"3"}]}